<html><body><div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#111827;line-height:1.5"><p>Hi {!People_Employee__c.First_Name__c},</p><p>Great news — we are almost at the finish line!</p><p>While we wait for your background check to come back, I have started your onboarding through Paychex, our HR and payroll platform. You will receive an email within the next 10–15 minutes from noreply@paychex.com on behalf of Paychex PEO Onboarding.</p><p>Please complete the New User Registration at your earliest convenience, but no later than {{SEND_DATE_PLUS_2}}.</p><p>Once you have completed your portion, I will finalize things on our end, and you will be all set!</p><p>If you have any trouble finding the email or accessing the form, please reach out to me right away.</p><p>Best regards,</p><p>{!User.Name}<br>{!User.Title}<br>Reach Home Loans<br>{!User.Phone}</p></div></body></html>